Scope of this license (ADR-0021)
=================================

The MIT License below covers the firmware source code of this project: the
original code we authored under `core/` (except the generated files noted
next), `hal/`, `app/`, `main/`, the build tooling under `tools/`, and the
tests under `test/`.

It does NOT cover, each of which keeps its own terms:

- The dictionary **data** — `data/*.json` and the generated
  `core/dictionary_gen.*` that mechanically transforms it — licensed
  CC BY-SA 4.0 (ADR-0016; see `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` and the `_license`
  field in `data/dictionary.json`).
- The build-time-generated asset files (`core/sitelen_gen.cpp`,
  `core/cjk_gen.cpp`, `core/logo_gen.cpp`) and the embedded fonts, which are
  derivatives of their upstream assets and follow those assets' licenses
  (MIT / OFL 1.1 / Adobe; see `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`).
- Third-party libraries linked at build time (e.g. LovyanGFX), under their
  own licenses.


